-40W-Dynamic-Power-Adapter-with-60W-Max-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple W Dynamic Power Adapter with W Max\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":125,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11045,\"date\":\"2025-11-13T19:38:57+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-13T18:38:57+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-fotocamera-sotto-display-24mp\",\"title\":\"iPhone Fold presenterà una fotocamera sotto il display da 24MP, prima nel settore\",\"excerpt\":\"Il primo iPhone pieghevole di Apple avrà una fotocamera sotto il display da 24 megapixel, secondo le ultime previsioni di JP Morgan.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/Apple-Foldable-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Foldable Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":123,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11031,\"date\":\"2025-11-10T15:57:45+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-10T14:57:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-valori-ritiro-iphone-ipad-mac\",\"title\":\"Apple Aggiorna i Valori di Ritiro per iPhone, iPad, Mac e Altro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha aggiornato i valori di ritiro per alcuni modelli di iPhone, iPad, Mac e Apple Watch. I ritiro possono essere effettuati sul sito web di Apple o presso un Apple Store.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/2024-iPhone-Boxes-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone Boxes Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a04